<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Farmacias Benavides cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Farmacias Benavides cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Debra Wang Smith on Friday cut her rating for Mexico's Farmacias Benavides to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, she said she made the downgrade &quot;given the outlook for a weaker operating margin in 1997 and 1998 owing to gross margin pressure from increased discounting by the company.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
